<title>ITALY: Milan bourse to start share trading at 1215 GMT.</title>
<headline>Milan bourse to start share trading at 1215 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the Milan bourse will start at 1215 GMT after technical problems delay the start of dealings on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock market council said that prices would start to be quoted at 1155 GMT, and continuous share trading would begin at 1215 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
